    {
      "id": "edRSqLnB940UV8MZjmwkm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2658.9813947455955,
      "y": 565.9143342819884,
      "width": 268.5392641364162,
      "height": 149.90600014839475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1470541599,
      "version": 386,
      "versionNonce": 965364209,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781087066342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hierarchal project-case\nDatahouse storing\nuploaded files, result files,\ncheckpoint directories and\na cached downloads\nfolder(7day persistence).",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hierarchal project-case Datahouse storing uploaded files, result files, checkpoint directories and a cached downloads folder(7day persistence).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ugEAb352ce5Q88EaFqA2a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2961.626557966176,
      "y": 566.3455152968907,
      "width": 268.5392641364162,
      "height": 199.87466686452632,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028014289,
      "version": 701,
      "versionNonce": 988240255,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781091709858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is the whole\nfrontend+API server and\nused to copy results from\nGCS, zip them, send them\nback to downloads folder.\nThis is on-demand,\ntriggered on request of\n'download all'.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is the whole frontend+API server and used to copy results from GCS, zip them, send them back to downloads folder. This is on-demand, triggered on request of 'download all'.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zw9n5xqrGYtqwk2HLdNmb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3649.632980614186,
      "y": 565.0098217722035,
      "width": 421.1392907758954,
      "height": 149.90600014839475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1101932113,
      "version": 1046,
      "versionNonce": 1308756287,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781089302649,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The machines running the simulations. We\nare using all cpu variants of c2d-highcpu\nmachine.\n\nWe have SOPT and Standard provisioning\noptions.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The machines running the simulations. We are using all cpu variants of c2d-highcpu machine.\n\nWe have SOPT and Standard provisioning options.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PMumCJC6Aw3sbu3Yr8zA_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4115.112724379153,
      "y": 557.6548275508493,
      "width": 395.2618222680638,
      "height": 249.84333358065788,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZIV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1668407775,
      "version": 1304,
      "versionNonce": 139986513,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781094482124,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We currently have 5 SA(1 default).\nof-ci-deployer: github WIF to build and\ndeploy the image , of-batch-backend:\nidentity Cloud Run runs as.\nSubmits/cancels Batch jobs, R/W\nbucket + Firestore, mints signed URLs.\nof-batch-job@ — identity the Batch VM\nruns as. of-pubsub-push@ — the\n\"badge\" Pub/Sub wears.\n",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We currently have 5 SA(1 default).\nof-ci-deployer: github WIF to build and deploy the image , of-batch-backend: identity Cloud Run runs as. Submits/cancels Batch jobs, R/W bucket + Firestore, mints signed URLs. of-batch-job@ — identity the Batch VM runs as. of-pubsub-push@ — the \"badge\" Pub/Sub wears.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s00xDaU0J1JIORk5REtzi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4557.832320466462,
      "y": 550.214765284941,
      "width": 348.33436757287103,
      "height": 124.92166679032894,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZIl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 672503391,
      "version": 1665,
      "versionNonce": 920268831,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781099552979,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The regions we use the GCP\nservices from. Currently all services\nare using us-central1 as the only\nregion choice with varying\nzones(a,b,c or d).",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The regions we use the GCP services from. Currently all services are using us-central1 as the only region choice with varying zones(a,b,c or d).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KmpCuE8i6swwgf9nHukya",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4558.9731115435725,
      "y": 824.6621516331909,
      "width": 348.33436757287103,
      "height": 24.98433335806579,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZIt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 882430769,
      "version": 1771,
      "versionNonce": 1979302463,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781099589304,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ingress cost is 0 in same region.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ingress cost is 0 in same region.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CdGP7yb2pddcA96wjZUAh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3658.2714978469353,
      "y": 829.6850696268423,
      "width": 422.03894899214094,
      "height": 149.90600014839475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1296890577,
      "version": 1313,
      "versionNonce": 1144180593,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781089306619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Have benchmarked c2, c3d, c4d machines on\nsinglephase, twophase and a STR case. All\nperformed poorer than c2d.\n\nSPOT and Standard choice is because\nspot is 60-90% cheaper than Standard.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Have benchmarked c2, c3d, c4d machines on singlephase, twophase and a STR case. All performed poorer than c2d.\n\nSPOT and Standard choice is because spot is 60-90% cheaper than Standard.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mynQeuUY6SbNSWSWIafvF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3654.830604096235,
      "y": 1117.703449332319,
      "width": 421.91299684186635,
      "height": 249.84333358065788,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZJV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1541006367,
      "version": 1879,
      "versionNonce": 2058059167,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781089538740,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The only limitation is the SPOT availability\nin a region. Our code and implementation\nworks with cancel-resume due to\ncheckpoints BUT if VM is not available\nthen the job fails.(although can be\nresumed after submitting a new job again\nWITH THE SAME MACHINE ONLY)\n\nNew approach of increasing maxRetries and\ngoing multizone can be tried.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The only limitation is the SPOT availability in a region. Our code and implementation works with cancel-resume due to checkpoints BUT if VM is not available then the job fails.(although can be resumed after submitting a new job again WITH THE SAME MACHINE ONLY)\n\nNew approach of increasing maxRetries and going multizone can be tried.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ljx9o0L11-lscdOHjnplS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3262.3834571912435,
      "y": 564.3022520978961,
      "width": 312.5279422734737,
      "height": 24.98433335806579,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
