      "seed": 801049631,
      "version": 611,
      "versionNonce": 1436596305,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781100001873,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "----",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "----",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LsEl5nJvJ11l_5QM9Pn-a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3261.6787677041025,
      "y": 571.0548462193078,
      "width": 318.9796238433085,
      "height": 174.89033350646054,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 869398577,
      "version": 838,
      "versionNonce": 17562289,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781088697185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Can run single-job-single-task\nOR single-job-multi-task\nworkloads through this service.\nSeparate VM per task/job ,\nrunning until the task/job is\ncompleted. Each VM gets n local\nSSDs attached on creation.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Can run single-job-single-task OR single-job-multi-task workloads through this service. Separate VM per task/job , running until the task/job is completed. Each VM gets n local SSDs attached on creation.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aH-ZetKXNg1Tc0qRicprZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3260.570987594197,
      "y": 830.1222245260196,
      "width": 356.9032165187574,
      "height": 249.84333358065788,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1602930225,
      "version": 1281,
      "versionNonce": 1898550801,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781088875571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dedicated VMs will keep running even\nafter task completion, batch is the\nstandard choice.\n\nTill 16vCPU localSSD=1, after that\na factor of 2(min.req. of GCP).\nLocalSSD is preferred over pd/hd\ncause anyways we are storing 30s\ncheckpoints in GCS, so no point\nhaving another persistent storage.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dedicated VMs will keep running even after task completion, batch is the standard choice.\n\nTill 16vCPU localSSD=1, after that a factor of 2(min.req. of GCP). LocalSSD is preferred over pd/hd cause anyways we are storing 30s checkpoints in GCS, so no point having another persistent storage.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x6pkeKVf_vT-x-sFUEqhq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3261.5024327744472,
      "y": 1130.6998329302764,
      "width": 318.9796238433085,
      "height": 99.93733343226316,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ae",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7572639,
      "version": 1184,
      "versionNonce": 527947409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781088926235,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CPU Quota-exhaustion might be\na limitation BUT that can be\neasily increased in minutes on\nrequest.",
      "fontSize": 19.98746668645263,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CPU Quota-exhaustion might be a limitation BUT that can be easily increased in minutes on request.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1t_c8flenWGcH6PHiJdB4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5290.66532092963,
      "y": 549.6574848575772,
      "width": 279.0492179890298,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1325759281,
      "version": 386,
      "versionNonce": 1918762367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781101315129,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Artifact Registry —\nstores the container images\n(backend + OpenFOAM\nruntime)\n- Pub/Sub — Batch job-\nstate events → backend\n- Cloud Logging — all Batch\n+ Cloud Run logs\n- WIF + IAM — keyless CI\nauth + role grants. \n\nEnabled but unused: Cloud\nBuild (CI builds with buildx,\nnot this), IAP (broken —\norg), Monitoring.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Artifact Registry — stores the container images (backend + OpenFOAM runtime)\n- Pub/Sub — Batch job-state events → backend\n- Cloud Logging — all Batch + Cloud Run logs\n- WIF + IAM — keyless CI auth + role grants. \n\nEnabled but unused: Cloud Build (CI builds with buildx, not this), IAP (broken — org), Monitoring.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iJmP-AqqfX1rumGX7PTgf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4116.637397975967,
      "y": 822.5430098370894,
      "width": 377.1094351162574,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ag",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 667220863,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 76777663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781092329107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " One identity per (where it runs × who\ncontrols it), each scoped to least\nprivilege. If CI/GitHub is compromised\nit can deploy but CANNOT read data\nor submit jobs.\npub-push has zero powers— it exists\nonly so the public /internal/batch-\nevents endpoint can tell a real\nPub/Sub event from a forged POST.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " One identity per (where it runs × who controls it), each scoped to least privilege. If CI/GitHub is compromised it can deploy but CANNOT read data or submit jobs.\npub-push has zero powers— it exists only so the public /internal/batch-events endpoint can tell a real Pub/Sub event from a forged POST.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sXBfKn7ZnuWjNDEHnm-uB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4134.342876201252,
      "y": 1126.7420363026195,
      "width": 358.5141852773042,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 530151505,
      "version": 363,
      "versionNonce": 442416959,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781094413208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IAP is currently broken, so we have\nto make App=external and check\norganization access through\nhosteddomain=lemnica.bio.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IAP is currently broken, so we have to make App=external and check organization access through hosteddomain=lemnica.bio.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Bhz561KNyQ0BArozUZOuo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4567.541517633114,
      "y": 1124.7046431681918,
      "width": 347.5610730952176,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1882160767,
      "version": 375,
      "versionNonce": 439401713,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781099987894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The only limitation for\nregions/zones comes when running\nSPOT jobs, on top of VM shortage\nacross GCP there is even lesser\navailable in a single region.\n\nWill try multi-region or multi-zone\njobs to test if incurring ingress\ncost is justifiable.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The only limitation for regions/zones comes when running SPOT jobs, on top of VM shortage across GCP there is even lesser available in a single region.\n\nWill try multi-region or multi-zone jobs to test if incurring ingress cost is justifiable.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uniMmscYxf8Zz1y_qWNGC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5021.106823811352,
      "y": 470.53592307036183,
      "width": 89.179931640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 993308657,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 2032567871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781100906263,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Firestore",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Firestore",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WCowxrR52ljKjXZBiJpA_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4951.2384971835145,
      "y": 549.1491132582428,
      "width": 305.97650959224933,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ak",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1420599473,
      "version": 182,
      "versionNonce": 1859211505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781101117328,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NoSQL metadata store\n(Native, us-central1). Holds run\n/ case / project records — the\napp's state + index. GCS = the\nfiles, Firestore = the metadata\nabout them. Serverless, scales\nto zero, no DB to run.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NoSQL metadata store (Native, us-central1). Holds run / case / project records — the app's state + index. GCS = the files, Firestore = the metadata about them. Serverless, scales to zero, no DB to run.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "i5Wssnu70Bl7wxeRKfu4W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4955.370954114679,
      "y": 818.9508813616544,
      "width": 305.97650959224933,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1115391679,
      "version": 280,
      "versionNonce": 1137375103,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781101124345,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Backend needs fast \"list my\nruns / cases / projects\"\nlookups without scanning GCS\nevery time(to not hit the API\nlimits). Records are doc-\nshaped, so a document DB\nfits. No server to manage, no\nconnection pooling.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Backend needs fast \"list my runs / cases / projects\" lookups without scanning GCS every time(to not hit the API limits). Records are doc-shaped, so a document DB fits. No server to manage, no connection pooling.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tXxVo2tEMyXp7kzjC7riq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4959.220187200081,
      "y": 1137.5740278593062,
      "width": 305.97650959224933,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 693853585,
      "version": 349,
      "versionNonce": 1806302399,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781101168269,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Single-region (us-central1) like\neverything else. No SQL joins /\nrelational queries — just key +\nsimple field lookups. Schema is\nenforced by our code, not the\nDB. Composite queries need\nmanual indexes.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Single-region (us-central1) like everything else. No SQL joins /  relational queries — just key + simple field lookups. Schema is enforced by our code, not the DB. Composite queries need manual indexes.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
